<title>POLAND: PROCHEM SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.66 MLN.</title>
<headline>PROCHEM SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.66 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.66 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.12 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.25 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Sales		    4.74 vs   5.33</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.44 vs   3.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.02 vs   4.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.92 vs   1.34</p>
<p> Sales		   26.33 vs  40.49</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish engineering company is Prochem</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
